{"version":2,"width":120,"height":40,"timestamp":1791953700,"title":"Codex 0.159.3 idle pane: selecting it resizes the PTY and Codex repaints","env":{"TERM":"xterm-256color"},"pm":{"agent":"codex","agent_version":"0.159.3","initial_status":"running","bug":"VERIFY #9: selecting an idle Codex pane remounts its terminal, the PTY resizes (120x30 to 141x51 in the live samples) and Codex reprints its screen. The reprint changed visible cells, the classifier read \"running\" and the pane flashed \"Working 0s\" for 5 s or more. Fixed by 8bdaedd (Codex declares its busy marker; for 2 s after a resize an idle pane only flips to running on real busy evidence).","source":["tui/codex/fixtures/standby_ready_live.txt (the idle composer, live Codex 0.159.3)","D:/pm-night/verify-r7/evidence/flicker-codex-samples.json (idle 120x30, then 141x51, status idle throughout after the fix; before it: running)","D:/pm-night/r8/codex-bufs.txt frame 3 (a real \"Working (1s - esc to interrupt)\" screen, for the closing check that real work still flips the pane)","The repaint at 141x51 is the 120-column capture reflowed (box and rules widened, footer moved right, composer bottom-anchored); the PTY resize and repaint times are synthetic."]}}
